            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Parrot learned everyone's name</h3><ul><li>Naming a voice lists everyone on the invite, with full names.</li><li>Pick a name another voice already has to join the two into one person.</li><li>Names you gave voices on earlier calls are offered again.</li><li>Two people with the same name stay two people.</li></ul><p><a href="https://openparrot.app/changelog#v0.29.7">Read the full story</a></p>
]]></description>
